  <p>
    This site is deliberately light on cookies. Here's the complete picture.
  </p>

  <h2>What we use</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Essential storage:</strong> none is required to browse this site. Signup forms submit directly without setting tracking cookies.</li>
    <li><strong>Analytics (if enabled):</strong> we may use a standard analytics tool (such as Google Analytics 4) to understand which pages help people and which don't. Analytics cookies identify a browser, not a person, and we use the data only in aggregate.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>What we don't do</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>No advertising or retargeting cookies.</li>
    <li>No selling or sharing of browsing data.</li>
    <li>No third-party social trackers.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Your controls</h2>
  <p>
    You can block or delete cookies in your browser settings at any time; this site works fully
    without them. If we later add a consent banner for analytics in regions that require one,
    your choice there will be respected.
  </p>

